         "label": "How Pricing Works",
         "name": "widget_1777309265552",
         "params": {
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "module_id": 211798581074,
          "outcome_spec_card": [
           {
            "card_context": "<p>Hop on a demo. We'll go over your channels, SKU count, warehouse setup, and where your process&nbsp;breaks down today.</p>",
            "outcome_stat": "01",
            "outcome_type": "We learn"
           },
           {
            "card_context": "<p>At the end of your demo, you'll know exactly what Flieber will cost \u2014 calculated from your sales volume, channels, and SKU count. No fine print to decode, no surprise add-ons.</p>",
            "outcome_stat": "02",
            "outcome_type": "We price"
           },
           {
            "card_context": "<p>Start a 14-day free trial \u2014 no credit card required. Our onboarding team helps you connect your data and configure your setup, so you can see Flieber work on your real operation from day one.</p>",
            "outcome_stat": "03",
            "outcome_type": "You try"
           },
           {
            "card_context": "<p>If Flieber's the right fit, continuing is simple. Add your card, review your setup, and keep going \u2014 your onboarding is already done from the trial.</p>",
            "outcome_stat": "04",
            "outcome_type": "You decide"
           }
          ],
          "schema_version": 2,
          "sec_title": "We learn. We price. You try. You decide.",
          "side_text": "No pressure. You can walk away at any step.",
          "subtitle": "How pricing works"
