      "rows": [
       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "In there words",
         "name": "widget_1777312039924",
         "params": {
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "module_id": 211806540603,
          "quote_box": {
           "brand_image": {
            "alt": "zugu",
            "height": 47,
            "loading": "lazy",
            "max_height": 47,
            "max_width": 144,
            "size_type": "auto",
            "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/zugu.png",
            "width": 144
           },
           "context": "<p>\"We sell on 8 marketplaces and Flieber lets us quickly forecast, replenish stock, and place more accurate POs. It's adapted to our specific needs and customizable in calculating suggestions. The staff and service is top notch \u2014 Flieber is not just a software to us but a true trusted partner.\"</p>"
          },
          "quote_box_grey": {
           "brand_image": {
            "alt": "vaer",
            "height": 43,
            "loading": "lazy",
            "max_height": 43,
            "max_width": 170,
            "size_type": "auto",
            "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/vaer.png",
            "width": 170
           },
           "context": "<p>\"Flieber\u2019s support has been phenomenal. We have quite a complex inventory planning structure, where many components are shared by different items. Andre and the rest of the team have helped us come up with custom solutions every step of the way. We are excited to use Flieber in the future for our inventory planning needs.\"</p>"
          },
          "quote_box_grey_2": {
           "brand_image": {
            "alt": "contour",
            "height": 143,
            "loading": "lazy",
            "max_height": 143,
            "max_width": 380,
            "size_type": "auto",
            "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/contour.png",
            "width": 380
           },
           "context": "\"The tool makes inventory management easier, and more reliable than manual forecasts sheets (its 2025, why do people still insist on Excel when there are awesome tools like this). For us, a big thing was the ability to roll up skus/alias into one forecast - for our use case this was a HUGE time saver.\""
          },
          "schema_version": 2,
          "sec_title": "From brands scaling with Flieber.",
          "subtitle": "In their words"
         },
