      "rows": [
       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "FAQ price new",
         "name": "widget_1777312845698",
         "params": {
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "faq_tile": [
           {
            "answer_text": "<p><span style=\"color: #757f82; background-color: #ffffff;\">Yes. You can start free for 14 days with no credit card required. Explore the platform, connect your data, and see it work for your business before any payment.</span></p>",
            "question_text": "Is there a free trial?"
           },
           {
            "answer_text": "<p>Pricing is calculated from a few key inputs about your business \u2014 sales volume, channels, and SKU count. We don't publish a public rate card because we want to walk you through the platform first, then show you exactly what it'll cost. No surprise add-ons, no fine print.</p>",
            "question_text": "How does pricing work?"
           },
           {
            "answer_text": "<p><span style=\"color: #757f82; background-color: #ffffff;\">Free, and fast. Most brands are fully set up in under an hour. Connect your sales channels, configure your key parameters, and Flieber starts working. No implementation fees, no consultants required.</span></p>",
            "question_text": "What does onboarding look like?"
           },
           {
            "answer_text": "<p><span style=\"color: #757f82; background-color: #ffffff;\">No. Flieber sits on top of whatever you already use and makes it smarter. If you don't have an ERP or IMS, Flieber can connect directly to your data source of preference.</span></p>",
            "question_text": "Do I need to replace my ERP or IMS?"
           },
           {
            "answer_text": "<p style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #757f82; line-height: 1.6;\">That works too. Flieber's Google Sheets integration lets you automate data input so you're not maintaining the same information in two places. Think of it as giving your spreadsheets a serious upgrade.</p>",
            "question_text": "What if I only use spreadsheets?"
           }
          ],
          "module_id": 211798788702,
